(6080347, 895483, 83313, '<td valign="top">The treatment has something of an old time hand colored appearance to it. The eyes are a bit oversharp and appear a little out of place with the rest of the shot.</td>', 'The treatment has something of an old time hand colored appearance to it. The eyes are a bit oversharp and appear a little out of place with the rest of the shot.', '2010-07-05 01:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080351, 895609, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gives him a bit of an Elton John look. I suspect those are not really his glasses, however.</td>', 'Gives him a bit of an Elton John look. I suspect those are not really his glasses, however.', '2010-07-05 01:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080355, 895681, 83313, '<td valign="top">Exit, stage left?</td>', 'Exit, stage left?', '2010-07-05 01:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080362, 895670, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice promo and action shot -- lovely processing.  But does not fit the bill for a portrait...</td>', 'Nice promo and action shot -- lovely processing.  But does not fit the bill for a portrait...', '2010-07-05 01:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080365, 895681, 49954, '<td valign="top">Appears to be a snapshot or candid</td>', 'Appears to be a snapshot or candid', '2010-07-05 01:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080367, 895680, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice work, although the lamp is distracting and she''s not looking at us...</td>', 'Nice work, although the lamp is distracting and she''s not looking at us...', '2010-07-05 01:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080368, 895223, 49954, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop and less distracting background would have helped this.</td>', 'A tighter crop and less distracting background would have helped this.', '2010-07-05 01:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080369, 895230, 83313, '<td valign="top">Makes me curious to know who she is and what her story may be. Looks like she could have been the pinup girl on the glass 40 or 50 years ago.</td>', 'Makes me curious to know who she is and what her story may be. Looks like she could have been the pinup girl on the glass 40 or 50 years ago.', '2010-07-05 01:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080370, 895609, 49954, '<td valign="top">interesting subject, but does not appear to be a professional portrait.  Closer crop and portrait orientation might have saved this one.</td>', 'interesting subject, but does not appear to be a professional portrait.  Closer crop and portrait orientation might have saved this one.', '2010-07-05 01:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080371, 895677, 49954, '<td valign="top">Appears to be a snapshot or candid</td>', 'Appears to be a snapshot or candid', '2010-07-05 01:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080373, 895514, 49954, '<td valign="top">Appears to be a snapshot or candid</td>', 'Appears to be a snapshot or candid', '2010-07-05 01:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080374, 894107, 103142, '<td valign="top">Sorry, that''s a candid! What an incredible shot, I wish you would have saved it for a free study, I can''t see it doing well here.</td>', 'Sorry, that''s a candid! What an incredible shot, I wish you would have saved it for a free study, I can''t see it doing well here.', '2010-07-05 01:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080376, 895103, 62357, '<td valign="top">I love the crumbs on his face :)</td>', 'I love the crumbs on his face :)', '2010-07-05 01:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080379, 895616, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like the creative way you have photographed him through the gun case. The treatment is coming off slightly flat to me, though. Due to the view through the glass, I''m sure. Certainly worth a positive vote from me.</td>', 'I really like the creative way you have photographed him through the gun case. The treatment is coming off slightly flat to me, though. Due to the view through the glass, I''m sure. Certainly worth a positive vote from me.', '2010-07-05 01:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080387, 895476, 83313, '<td valign="top">The perspective seems a little awkward to me, as if it got squished slightly in post processing.</td>', 'The perspective seems a little awkward to me, as if it got squished slightly in post processing.', '2010-07-05 01:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080391, 895488, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to know a little more about this interesting character.</td>', 'I''m curious to know a little more about this interesting character.', '2010-07-05 01:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080395, 895438, 62357, '<td valign="top">Oh this is a very strong entry.  I love it.  Good luck!</td>', 'Oh this is a very strong entry.  I love it.  Good luck!', '2010-07-05 01:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080402, 895465, 68947, '<td valign="top">OMG...does she EVER look like a young Whoopi!!!  :)</td>', 'OMG...does she EVER look like a young Whoopi!!!  :)', '2010-07-05 01:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080403, 895670, 83313, '<td valign="top">Has the look of something planned, but in all likelihood, you lucked into some businessmen on break with a great sense of humor.</td>', 'Has the look of something planned, but in all likelihood, you lucked into some businessmen on break with a great sense of humor.', '2010-07-05 01:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
