(6080434, 895616, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though a tighter crop on him would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea, though a tighter crop on him would be better.', '2010-07-05 01:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080436, 895628, 62357, '<td valign="top">Probably not the only one to say it, but the guy has a sign sticking out of his head.</td>', 'Probably not the only one to say it, but the guy has a sign sticking out of his head.', '2010-07-05 01:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080438, 895608, 109478, '<td valign="top">The model is nice, but the image resolution looks poor.</td>', 'The model is nice, but the image resolution looks poor.', '2010-07-05 01:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080442, 895517, 49954, '<td valign="top">dimensions too odd for a portrait... Cropping out the sode would have helped and it''s not "perfect" product placement since you cannot see the brand.</td>', 'dimensions too odd for a portrait... Cropping out the sode would have helped and it''s not "perfect" product placement since you cannot see the brand.', '2010-07-05 01:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080443, 895608, 83313, '<td valign="top">Tons of blocky compression artifacts are showing. Your file size is a bit on the small side, but does not fully account for compression artifacts this heavy. I wonder if you repeatedly opened and saved as a JPG a few times. That could induce the excessive compression artifacts. Always save in an uncompressed format, such as TIF, PSD, or PSPIMAGE until the final resize and save as JPG. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.<br/> <br/>Overall, the image looks a bit flat as well, with blown highlights in the background. And the subject is not framed well, being cut off at the frame edge.<br/> <br/>Sorry to be so harsh on it this early in voting, but I feel I should at least explain a low vote if I can identify the reasons for it.</td>', 'Tons of blocky compression artifacts are showing. Your file size is a bit on the small side, but does not fully account for compression artifacts this heavy. I wonder if you repeatedly opened and saved as a JPG a few times. That could induce the excessive compression artifacts. Always save in an uncompressed format, such as TIF, PSD, or PSPIMAGE until the final resize and save as JPG. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. Overall, the image looks a bit flat as well, with blown highlights in the background. And the subject is not framed well, being cut off at the frame edge. Sorry to be so harsh on it this early in voting, but I feel I should at least explain a low vote if I can identify the reasons for it.', '2010-07-05 01:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080452, 895321, 49954, '<td valign="top">closer crop would work better</td>', 'closer crop would work better', '2010-07-05 01:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080453, 895676, 49954, '<td valign="top">more of him and less of the accordion would have worked better</td>', 'more of him and less of the accordion would have worked better', '2010-07-05 01:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080458, 895200, 49954, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot... have to wonder how you lucked out that she had on perfect makeup though...</td>', 'Beautiful shot... have to wonder how you lucked out that she had on perfect makeup though...', '2010-07-05 01:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080465, 895408, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun guy. Street performer?</td>', 'Looks like a fun guy. Street performer?', '2010-07-05 01:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080469, 895403, 109478, '<td valign="top">nice model and composition, love his crossing hand</td>', 'nice model and composition, love his crossing hand', '2010-07-05 01:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080470, 895681, 109478, '<td valign="top">special composition</td>', 'special composition', '2010-07-05 01:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080473, 895415, 83313, '<td valign="top">This seems a little soft on the detail and I see some artifacts near her legs, so I looked at the file size. There is some excessive JPEG compression taking away some detail. Your file size is only 54k and you could have used up to 300k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits. Most image editors have that ability to adjust compression somewhere in the file save dialog.<br/> <br/>The shot itself does not not seem like an impromptu portrait to me. More like a snapshot or street photography. I''m afraid I have to give this my "good effort, but no cigar" vote.</td>', 'This seems a little soft on the detail and I see some artifacts near her legs, so I looked at the file size. There is some excessive JPEG compression taking away some detail. Your file size is only 54k and you could have used up to 300k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits. Most image editors have that ability to adjust compression somewhere in the file save dialog. The shot itself does not not seem like an impromptu portrait to me. More like a snapshot or street photography. I''m afraid I have to give this my "good effort, but no cigar" vote.', '2010-07-05 01:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080474, 895039, 109478, '<td valign="top">I wish that I can see the man''s face more clearly than the dogs.</td>', 'I wish that I can see the man''s face more clearly than the dogs.', '2010-07-05 01:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080476, 895459, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooh. . .good one!  Wish I had seen him instead of you  :)  Just kidding.  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I really had to comment on how much I like this one!</td>', 'Oooooh. . .good one!  Wish I had seen him instead of you  :)  Just kidding.  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I really had to comment on how much I like this one!', '2010-07-05 01:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080477, 895625, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looking forward to hearing the story behind this one.</td>', 'Looking forward to hearing the story behind this one.', '2010-07-05 01:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080480, 895610, 24454, '<td valign="top">GOOD ONE!  What a story this tells.  I love those "hip huggers"  :)  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I love the picture so I wanted to comment on it.</td>', 'GOOD ONE!  What a story this tells.  I love those "hip huggers"  :)  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I love the picture so I wanted to comment on it.', '2010-07-05 01:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080481, 895386, 83313, '<td valign="top">Perhaps something shot at a renaissance fair? I love the goofy face, and you did very well for something with heavy shadows and bright highlights.</td>', 'Perhaps something shot at a renaissance fair? I love the goofy face, and you did very well for something with heavy shadows and bright highlights.', '2010-07-05 01:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080483, 895611, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww, he looks like the kinda guy I like to find.  Good catch.  I love that radiant spirit.  It tells such a story of circumstance not needing to be the defining "thing" in your life.  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I really love the picture!</td>', 'Awwww, he looks like the kinda guy I like to find.  Good catch.  I love that radiant spirit.  It tells such a story of circumstance not needing to be the defining "thing" in your life.  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I really love the picture!', '2010-07-05 01:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080484, 895569, 109478, '<td valign="top">nice color</td>', 'nice color', '2010-07-05 01:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080485, 894107, 24454, '<td valign="top">Aauuugh! What a GREAT nature shot!  Congratulations, both to you AND the bird :)  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I really had to comment on how much I like this one!</td>', 'Aauuugh! What a GREAT nature shot!  Congratulations, both to you AND the bird :)  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I really had to comment on how much I like this one!', '2010-07-05 01:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080486, 895312, 83313, '<td valign="top">Midday sun is the main problem here. Midday sun sucks. Otherwise, the technicals are good. Well exposed and sharp. The orange jumpsuit contrasts nicely against the blue of the background.</td>', 'Midday sun is the main problem here. Midday sun sucks. Otherwise, the technicals are good. Well exposed and sharp. The orange jumpsuit contrasts nicely against the blue of the background.', '2010-07-05 01:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080488, 894726, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh man!  This has to win!  I''ve been thru most of the pictures now, and this is it.  You''re the best at this! I''m not voting on this challenge, but I''m definitely picking this one for a ribbon.</td>', 'Oh man!  This has to win!  I''ve been thru most of the pictures now, and this is it.  You''re the best at this! I''m not voting on this challenge, but I''m definitely picking this one for a ribbon.', '2010-07-05 01:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080490, 895465, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awww, she is BEAUTIFUL!  And she is also photographed to perfection!  I love the texture in her skin and the high contrast.  GREAT JOB!  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I absolutely love this one!</td>', 'Awww, she is BEAUTIFUL!  And she is also photographed to perfection!  I love the texture in her skin and the high contrast.  GREAT JOB!  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I absolutely love this one!', '2010-07-05 01:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080493, 895359, 24454, '<td valign="top">I LOVE IT!  HE is FASCINATING.  I''d love to have him in my collection of street portraits.  Congratulations!  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I wanted to comment and say how cool this one is!</td>', 'I LOVE IT!  HE is FASCINATING.  I''d love to have him in my collection of street portraits.  Congratulations!  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I wanted to comment and say how cool this one is!', '2010-07-05 01:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080494, 895450, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting character. Midday sun is a problem for this shot, however. The highlights are too bright, the shadows too dark, and he is squinting into the sun. Midday sun is a difficult time of day to get good photos.</td>', 'An interesting character. Midday sun is a problem for this shot, however. The highlights are too bright, the shadows too dark, and he is squinting into the sun. Midday sun is a difficult time of day to get good photos.', '2010-07-05 01:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080495, 895508, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, I love it!  Such an interesting subject for the challenge, and the light and processing are amazing!  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I wanted to comment and tell you how much I love this!</td>', 'Ooooh, I love it!  Such an interesting subject for the challenge, and the light and processing are amazing!  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I wanted to comment and tell you how much I love this!', '2010-07-05 01:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080497, 895506, 83313, '<td valign="top">Her face seems too red to me. Otherwise I''d find this a very nice street portrait.</td>', 'Her face seems too red to me. Otherwise I''d find this a very nice street portrait.', '2010-07-05 02:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080498, 895200, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing portrait!  I love the texture in her skin and the perfect color tones.  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I just love this photo and wanted to comment on it.</td>', 'This is an amazing portrait!  I love the texture in her skin and the perfect color tones.  I''m not voting in this challenge, but I just love this photo and wanted to comment on it.', '2010-07-05 02:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080503, 894107, 83313, '<td valign="top">You entered this knowing it would get creamed, didn''t you? I just read through the challenge description and it does <b>not</b> say it must be a human. I think "human" was the spirit of the challenge, but I do have to give you kudos for a finding a creative loophole. It''s also a great shot of a Heron.</td>', 'You entered this knowing it would get creamed, didn''t you? I just read through the challenge description and it does not say it must be a human. I think "human" was the spirit of the challenge, but I do have to give you kudos for a finding a creative loophole. It''s also a great shot of a Heron.', '2010-07-05 02:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080505, 894595, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ow. Makes me feel my own problem are nothing at all. Did you buy him that taco?</td>', 'Ow. Makes me feel my own problem are nothing at all. Did you buy him that taco?', '2010-07-05 02:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
