(6080509, 895435, 24454, '<td valign="top">:)  I LOVE this one!  What a great pet owner she is  :)  I''m not voting in this challenge, but this is one of my favorites!</td>', ':)  I LOVE this one!  What a great pet owner she is  :)  I''m not voting in this challenge, but this is one of my favorites!', '2010-07-05 02:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080513, 895610, 83313, '<td valign="top">How the heck does a person walk with their pants down that low? Might make an interesting video for YouTube.</td>', 'How the heck does a person walk with their pants down that low? Might make an interesting video for YouTube.', '2010-07-05 02:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080516, 895206, 98022, '<td valign="top">Great processing. Looks like a happy guy!</td>', 'Great processing. Looks like a happy guy!', '2010-07-05 02:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080532, 895565, 109478, '<td valign="top">cute beard</td>', 'cute beard', '2010-07-05 02:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080533, 895676, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful details and involvement. This looks really well!</td>', 'Wonderful details and involvement. This looks really well!', '2010-07-05 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080534, 895435, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like this "street portrait" in that you included a larger point of view to give context of the environment.  Lighting looks good.  You caught the different elements in this pic (great smile of the subject; the vender feeding the dog) to make this a very fun portrait to look at.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'I like this "street portrait" in that you included a larger point of view to give context of the environment.  Lighting looks good.  You caught the different elements in this pic (great smile of the subject; the vender feeding the dog) to make this a very fun portrait to look at.  One of my top picks.', '2010-07-05 02:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080535, 895223, 109478, '<td valign="top">nice model, but the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'nice model, but the background is a little distracting.', '2010-07-05 02:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080536, 895432, 100831, '<td valign="top">nice capture. wonderful tones and great smile!</td>', 'nice capture. wonderful tones and great smile!', '2010-07-05 02:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080538, 895311, 100831, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. She looks like a wonderful woman with a lot of stories to tell.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. She looks like a wonderful woman with a lot of stories to tell.', '2010-07-05 02:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080541, 895105, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Nice background blur but enough detail to give context to the environment.  Great entry.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Nice background blur but enough detail to give context to the environment.  Great entry.', '2010-07-05 02:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080542, 895624, 109478, '<td valign="top">nice background</td>', 'nice background', '2010-07-05 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080543, 895526, 100831, '<td valign="top">Direct, compelling portrait. Excellent work.</td>', 'Direct, compelling portrait. Excellent work.', '2010-07-05 02:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080546, 895670, 109478, '<td valign="top">very joyful :D</td>', 'very joyful :D', '2010-07-05 02:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080563, 895539, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is a tight street portrait.  Even w/o the title the subject appears to be someone into water sports (hmm, but with the Canon strap, a fellow photographer...?).  Well composed, nice bokeh but can still tell its in a water environment. Nice job.</td>', 'This is a tight street portrait.  Even w/o the title the subject appears to be someone into water sports (hmm, but with the Canon strap, a fellow photographer...?).  Well composed, nice bokeh but can still tell its in a water environment. Nice job.', '2010-07-05 02:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080566, 895432, 103032, '<td valign="top">Lots of character in this subject.  I can make out the mast of the boat in the background, but I think just a bit more DOF to give context to the subject would have made this a stronger street portrait.  Just MHO.</td>', 'Lots of character in this subject.  I can make out the mast of the boat in the background, but I think just a bit more DOF to give context to the subject would have made this a stronger street portrait.  Just MHO.', '2010-07-05 02:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080567, 895303, 32767, '<td valign="top">The processing is pretty far over the top. You don''t need all that.</td>', 'The processing is pretty far over the top. You don''t need all that.', '2010-07-05 02:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080568, 895510, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of the collector and his prize.</td>', 'Nice portrait of the collector and his prize.', '2010-07-05 02:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080594, 894726, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is a great street portrait.  Like how you positioned him on the stoop.  Quite an interesting character study.  Looks like he had a hard life; with the bags under his eyes, lines on his face; tats on his arms, maybe scars on his right shoulder.  If you posed him (or just asked him to sit), his shoulders drooped over also gives an impression of a hard life.  I also like your processing, as the blues look toned down a touch, giving the entire image a "depressed" tone (if that makes sense.)  Outstanding street portrait.</td>', 'This is a great street portrait.  Like how you positioned him on the stoop.  Quite an interesting character study.  Looks like he had a hard life; with the bags under his eyes, lines on his face; tats on his arms, maybe scars on his right shoulder.  If you posed him (or just asked him to sit), his shoulders drooped over also gives an impression of a hard life.  I also like your processing, as the blues look toned down a touch, giving the entire image a "depressed" tone (if that makes sense.)  Outstanding street portrait.', '2010-07-05 03:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080597, 895311, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful capture that really tugs at my heart. Makes me want to cry. And she can still put on a smile in spite of it all. I hope you''ve included details of her story in the Photographer''s Comments.</td>', 'This is a beautiful capture that really tugs at my heart. Makes me want to cry. And she can still put on a smile in spite of it all. I hope you''ve included details of her story in the Photographer''s Comments.', '2010-07-05 03:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080600, 895616, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wish your subject had a little more contrast.</td>', 'Wish your subject had a little more contrast.', '2010-07-05 03:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
