(6080625, 895230, 5822, '<td valign="top">Even with the technical flaw (hair blown out) I love it! That sticker is probably a spittin image of Julie in her younger years.</td>', 'Even with the technical flaw (hair blown out) I love it! That sticker is probably a spittin image of Julie in her younger years.', '2010-07-05 04:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080629, 895403, 108525, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2010-07-05 04:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080630, 895540, 5822, '<td valign="top">Like her smile and gaze, but the light is too harsh.</td>', 'Like her smile and gaze, but the light is too harsh.', '2010-07-05 04:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080632, 895216, 5822, '<td valign="top">Well executed portrait. I especially like your POV and the bokeh is great. Patch of sky is a bit distracting, I find.</td>', 'Well executed portrait. I especially like your POV and the bokeh is great. Patch of sky is a bit distracting, I find.', '2010-07-05 04:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080634, 895608, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a really fine portrait that I like a lot, but your post processing lets it down a bit. Foremost, you''ve applied way too aggressive a compression resulting in artifacts throughout your subject. Advanced Editing rules allow for about 6 times the size of this photo. I''m not sure if that''s also the reason for the porcelainish skin tones and lack of texture in her uniform, or because of too high an amount of noise reduction applied. Another couple of nit picks is her left elbow and brim of her hat are cut off, and the borders. One side has a big red stripe and the other has a thing brown stripe. I imagine that''s just carelessness.  All easy to go back and correct and you''ll have something to be proud about.</td>', 'This is a really fine portrait that I like a lot, but your post processing lets it down a bit. Foremost, you''ve applied way too aggressive a compression resulting in artifacts throughout your subject. Advanced Editing rules allow for about 6 times the size of this photo. I''m not sure if that''s also the reason for the porcelainish skin tones and lack of texture in her uniform, or because of too high an amount of noise reduction applied. Another couple of nit picks is her left elbow and brim of her hat are cut off, and the borders. One side has a big red stripe and the other has a thing brown stripe. I imagine that''s just carelessness.  All easy to go back and correct and you''ll have something to be proud about.', '2010-07-05 04:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080635, 895200, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait with a mystique to it. Love her expression and your point of view. Though I like the bokeh, I think your DOF is a bit too narrow and would have liked to have seen both eyes in focus. Lighting is a bit hot on her forehead and nose and your crop of her ear is not tight enough imo (to eliminate it).</td>', 'Excellent portrait with a mystique to it. Love her expression and your point of view. Though I like the bokeh, I think your DOF is a bit too narrow and would have liked to have seen both eyes in focus. Lighting is a bit hot on her forehead and nose and your crop of her ear is not tight enough imo (to eliminate it).', '2010-07-05 04:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080636, 895611, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! This is so good. Love your processing and the slightly off center crop and the lines of the background brickwork. He really radiates happiness, or is it because your just paid him a lot of money to take his picture? :)</td>', 'Wonderful! This is so good. Love your processing and the slightly off center crop and the lines of the background brickwork. He really radiates happiness, or is it because your just paid him a lot of money to take his picture? :)', '2010-07-05 04:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080638, 895465, 5822, '<td valign="top">Endearing smile and expression. And she does look like Whoopi. Was my first thoguht.</td>', 'Endearing smile and expression. And she does look like Whoopi. Was my first thoguht.', '2010-07-05 04:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080682, 895578, 89522, '<td valign="top">Nice Portret, soft face, the flowerprint dress and the not expected tatoes. Very well spotted! I realy like this colorfull girl in front of the grey wall.</td>', 'Nice Portret, soft face, the flowerprint dress and the not expected tatoes. Very well spotted! I realy like this colorfull girl in front of the grey wall.', '2010-07-05 06:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080683, 895535, 89522, '<td valign="top">Yep, happy people keep the world going.</td>', 'Yep, happy people keep the world going.', '2010-07-05 06:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080685, 895458, 89522, '<td valign="top">Something on the other end off the lens must have made him smiling. Nice picture.</td>', 'Something on the other end off the lens must have made him smiling. Nice picture.', '2010-07-05 07:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080712, 895438, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, i like the thin DOF, and i think you made the right choice to go B&amp;W. The only thing i can say is that his expression almost looks like you took him by surprise. Maybe i''m wrong you may have spent a good 15 minutes chatting him up, but his expression fails to connect emotionally. Technically you did great.</td>', 'Nice photo, i like the thin DOF, and i think you made the right choice to go B&W. The only thing i can say is that his expression almost looks like you took him by surprise. Maybe i''m wrong you may have spent a good 15 minutes chatting him up, but his expression fails to connect emotionally. Technically you did great.', '2010-07-05 07:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080717, 895320, 100335, '<td valign="top">I''m sure i wont be the only one to mention the strange artifacts in the image. That aside, your photo seems busy with many things and fails to draw the eyes to a certain point. 5.</td>', 'I''m sure i wont be the only one to mention the strange artifacts in the image. That aside, your photo seems busy with many things and fails to draw the eyes to a certain point. 5.', '2010-07-05 07:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080719, 895480, 100335, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''ve smoothed his skin, I have to say I would have preferred seeing this in a grunge look, even your model''s shirt looks grungy. But then again thats just me :D</td>', 'It looks like you''ve smoothed his skin, I have to say I would have preferred seeing this in a grunge look, even your model''s shirt looks grungy. But then again thats just me :D', '2010-07-05 07:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080721, 895680, 100335, '<td valign="top">Kinda hard to believe this is a "street" portrait of a stranger. Looks like a model. If she is a stranger off the street i have to say nice find!! Where do you live?? hehe</td>', 'Kinda hard to believe this is a "street" portrait of a stranger. Looks like a model. If she is a stranger off the street i have to say nice find!! Where do you live?? hehe', '2010-07-05 07:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080722, 895103, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice processing, and i like that you resisted the urge to clean those imperfections around the cheeks and eyes. Great work.</td>', 'Nice processing, and i like that you resisted the urge to clean those imperfections around the cheeks and eyes. Great work.', '2010-07-05 07:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080723, 895533, 100335, '<td valign="top">Background color dominates a little, and her hand seems to be in an awkward pose, looks as though she was in the middle of saying something.</td>', 'Background color dominates a little, and her hand seems to be in an awkward pose, looks as though she was in the middle of saying something.', '2010-07-05 07:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080726, 895513, 100335, '<td valign="top">I like your crop, and i like the overall image and composition. However, i think his expression is that of someone bored and uninterested in what you''re doing.  Its just such a neutral expression. Those are just my thoughts i hope you take them as such :D</td>', 'I like your crop, and i like the overall image and composition. However, i think his expression is that of someone bored and uninterested in what you''re doing.  Its just such a neutral expression. Those are just my thoughts i hope you take them as such :D', '2010-07-05 07:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080727, 895476, 100335, '<td valign="top">OMG you found george bush!!</td>', 'OMG you found george bush!!', '2010-07-05 07:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080729, 895535, 100335, '<td valign="top">I like the emotion you''ve captured here. Processing looks a touch overdone for my liking. The red plastic netting is also competing with your subject for attention. I really like his expression would have loved to see it up close. Unfortunately you can never ask someone to laugh again for you hehe.</td>', 'I like the emotion you''ve captured here. Processing looks a touch overdone for my liking. The red plastic netting is also competing with your subject for attention. I really like his expression would have loved to see it up close. Unfortunately you can never ask someone to laugh again for you hehe.', '2010-07-05 07:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080730, 895633, 100335, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, tough guy, ice cream, pretty funny, but, his face looks airbrushed and that really takes away from the "tough guy" look. I could be wrong, maybe this tough guy uses revlon and you never smoothed his skin. Overall tho nice processing and idea. Something different than just a straight up portrait of a bland expression.</td>', 'I like the idea, tough guy, ice cream, pretty funny, but, his face looks airbrushed and that really takes away from the "tough guy" look. I could be wrong, maybe this tough guy uses revlon and you never smoothed his skin. Overall tho nice processing and idea. Something different than just a straight up portrait of a bland expression.', '2010-07-05 07:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080731, 894107, 100335, '<td valign="top">Sorry this just comes across as a shoehorn to me. I think part of the challenge was to get people to interact with strangers. Thats my take on it at least.</td>', 'Sorry this just comes across as a shoehorn to me. I think part of the challenge was to get people to interact with strangers. Thats my take on it at least.', '2010-07-05 07:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080732, 895386, 100335, '<td valign="top">Hahah nice catch and expression.</td>', 'Hahah nice catch and expression.', '2010-07-05 07:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080734, 895432, 100335, '<td valign="top">This is raw. I love it. I love the expression. I love the reality. My only comment is that i think you pushed him to the left a little too much. The background is blurred to the point that i don''t nkow what i''m looking at. I think its boats? Excellent portrait nonetheless. 7.</td>', 'This is raw. I love it. I love the expression. I love the reality. My only comment is that i think you pushed him to the left a little too much. The background is blurred to the point that i don''t nkow what i''m looking at. I think its boats? Excellent portrait nonetheless. 7.', '2010-07-05 07:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080736, 895359, 100335, '<td valign="top">A touch bright but very interesting subject and image regardless. I think in this case the soft and shallow DOF have worked against you. Thats just my opinion i like grungy images and this guy is full of it but the thin DOF takes some of that away.</td>', 'A touch bright but very interesting subject and image regardless. I think in this case the soft and shallow DOF have worked against you. Thats just my opinion i like grungy images and this guy is full of it but the thin DOF takes some of that away.', '2010-07-05 07:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080739, 895611, 100335, '<td valign="top">Thumbnail looks good, when i clicked it i have to admit I was a little disappointed. The background is too dominant and the processing is a little heavy handed. Otherwise a very touching subject and even more touching to see such a wonderful smile on his face. 5 from me.</td>', 'Thumbnail looks good, when i clicked it i have to admit I was a little disappointed. The background is too dominant and the processing is a little heavy handed. Otherwise a very touching subject and even more touching to see such a wonderful smile on his face. 5 from me.', '2010-07-05 07:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
