(6080907, 895230, 75618, '<td valign="top">Very captivating character study. I love the interesting juxtaposition and the toning. Not a fan of the excessive glow in the hair though. 8</td>', 'Very captivating character study. I love the interesting juxtaposition and the toning. Not a fan of the excessive glow in the hair though. 8', '2010-07-05 11:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080960, 895320, 30861, '<td valign="top">Look at the TEETH! In all your happy color-warping you''ve made the teeth flourescent :-(</td>', 'Look at the TEETH! In all your happy color-warping you''ve made the teeth flourescent :-(', '2010-07-05 12:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080964, 895311, 100335, '<td valign="top">What a cute old lady, i hope to see this in top 10. Lovely portrait.</td>', 'What a cute old lady, i hope to see this in top 10. Lovely portrait.', '2010-07-05 12:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6080970, 895484, 24454, '<td valign="top">Auuuugh!  I LOVE this photo!  L-O-V-E it!!!  I have a feeling it is scoring very well for you and I hope it wins!  Knowing this dpc crowd a bit, I''m thinking it may have even scored higher if it were a black and white or sepia, but if it''s not in the 7''s, you''re getting robbed!  I''m not voting this time, but just wanted to tell you how much I love your work here!</td>', 'Auuuugh!  I LOVE this photo!  L-O-V-E it!!!  I have a feeling it is scoring very well for you and I hope it wins!  Knowing this dpc crowd a bit, I''m thinking it may have even scored higher if it were a black and white or sepia, but if it''s not in the 7''s, you''re getting robbed!  I''m not voting this time, but just wanted to tell you how much I love your work here!', '2010-07-05 12:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081000, 895569, 96751, '<td valign="top">The lighting almost looks like a studio shot!  Wonderful colors.  A tad more light on her face?</td>', 'The lighting almost looks like a studio shot!  Wonderful colors.  A tad more light on her face?', '2010-07-05 13:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081001, 895403, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous perspective and dof.  Front page.</td>', 'Fabulous perspective and dof.  Front page.', '2010-07-05 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081002, 895103, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something so unusual about this face.  The features are young, but the expression and energy are old. Very interesting.</td>', 'There is something so unusual about this face.  The features are young, but the expression and energy are old. Very interesting.', '2010-07-05 13:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081003, 894726, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hey, it''s George Carlin!  Wonderful character.</td>', 'Hey, it''s George Carlin!  Wonderful character.', '2010-07-05 13:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081007, 895230, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Perfectly processed.</td>', 'Love it.  Perfectly processed.', '2010-07-05 13:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081011, 895677, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very artistic.  I love negative space, but this is a bit much.  I think a crop on the right to eliminate the little pink cloud would not have hurt the intention of the image.</td>', 'Very artistic.  I love negative space, but this is a bit much.  I think a crop on the right to eliminate the little pink cloud would not have hurt the intention of the image.', '2010-07-05 13:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081014, 895386, 96751, '<td valign="top">The Renaissance Faire was THIS weekend???  Wonderful.</td>', 'The Renaissance Faire was THIS weekend???  Wonderful.', '2010-07-05 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081016, 895435, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  I love the matching long hair.</td>', 'Hilarious!  I love the matching long hair.', '2010-07-05 13:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081018, 895565, 96751, '<td valign="top">That is some SERIOUS facial hair.  Was it difficult to approach this guy?</td>', 'That is some SERIOUS facial hair.  Was it difficult to approach this guy?', '2010-07-05 13:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081020, 895465, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very sweet image.  Lovely b/w</td>', 'Very sweet image.  Lovely b/w', '2010-07-05 13:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081021, 895668, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love how the shopping carts almost look like they''re images from his imagination.  Nicely framed and shot.</td>', 'I love how the shopping carts almost look like they''re images from his imagination.  Nicely framed and shot.', '2010-07-05 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081024, 895408, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m really enjoying the images where the subject added emotional content.  Well done.</td>', 'I''m really enjoying the images where the subject added emotional content.  Well done.', '2010-07-05 13:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081026, 895432, 96751, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this more if the background weren''t in such competition with the subject.  My eye is drawn there to try to figure out what I''m looking at, and away from the otherwise wonderful main subject.</td>', 'I would have liked this more if the background weren''t in such competition with the subject.  My eye is drawn there to try to figure out what I''m looking at, and away from the otherwise wonderful main subject.', '2010-07-05 13:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081027, 895508, 96751, '<td valign="top">Weird and wonderful.</td>', 'Weird and wonderful.', '2010-07-05 13:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081031, 895519, 96751, '<td valign="top">That shock of white hair is a statement unto itself.  Almost like an exclamation point to her expression.  Wonderful image.</td>', 'That shock of white hair is a statement unto itself.  Almost like an exclamation point to her expression.  Wonderful image.', '2010-07-05 13:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081034, 895624, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!  Her expression, the location, the processing.  I might have cropped a bit off either end to emphasize the face as the main subject.</td>', 'Fabulous!  Her expression, the location, the processing.  I might have cropped a bit off either end to emphasize the face as the main subject.', '2010-07-05 13:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081037, 895613, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the processing on this.  Dreamy.  Uh, the guys is cute too...</td>', 'I love the processing on this.  Dreamy.  Uh, the guys is cute too...', '2010-07-05 13:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081039, 895670, 96751, '<td valign="top">Kuddos for getting four grown strangers to monkey around for you, although the remote location, the matching suits/ties, lead me to believe this was staged.  Fabulous anyway.</td>', 'Kuddos for getting four grown strangers to monkey around for you, although the remote location, the matching suits/ties, lead me to believe this was staged.  Fabulous anyway.', '2010-07-05 13:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081041, 895341, 32767, '<td valign="top">It may or may not be but it seems too candid. The tilt is also a bit extreme. Given the choice I probably would have placed the guitars head in the top right to avoid that falling over feel.Cheers</td>', 'It may or may not be but it seems too candid. The tilt is also a bit extreme. Given the choice I probably would have placed the guitars head in the top right to avoid that falling over feel.Cheers', '2010-07-05 13:25:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6081042, 895517, 96751, '<td valign="top">Well, not perfect.  We''d have seen the product name if it had been... :-)</td>', 'Well, not perfect.  We''d have seen the product name if it had been... :-)', '2010-07-05 13:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081043, 895611, 96751, '<td valign="top">This looks like a daguerrotype!</td>', 'This looks like a daguerrotype!', '2010-07-05 13:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081044, 895480, 32767, '<td valign="top">There''s quite a bit of void space above his head. Not sure why you didn''t crop it off to bring the viewer right into his expression.</td>', 'There''s quite a bit of void space above his head. Not sure why you didn''t crop it off to bring the viewer right into his expression.', '2010-07-05 13:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081045, 895610, 96751, '<td valign="top">Never understood this particular style of having your pants belted UNDER your butt.  But great image.</td>', 'Never understood this particular style of having your pants belted UNDER your butt.  But great image.', '2010-07-05 13:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081048, 895484, 32767, '<td valign="top">Saturation appears a bit over the top. It''s causing some haloing around his head. Kind of a no, no BUT on 3rd world appeal this should do pretty well.</td>', 'Saturation appears a bit over the top. It''s causing some haloing around his head. Kind of a no, no BUT on 3rd world appeal this should do pretty well.', '2010-07-05 13:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081053, 895403, 32767, '<td valign="top">Easily the best shot in the Challenge....simply for the composition alone. ah''m jes prayin this is the real goods. Cheers!</td>', 'Easily the best shot in the Challenge....simply for the composition alone. ah''m jes prayin this is the real goods. Cheers!', '2010-07-05 13:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6081054, 895200, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the dof, and the harsh lighting works for me, although I suspect there''ll be comments about it.  The little triangle under her eye seems to underscore it.</td>', 'Love the dof, and the harsh lighting works for me, although I suspect there''ll be comments about it.  The little triangle under her eye seems to underscore it.', '2010-07-05 13:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
