(6082125, 894595, 32767, '<td valign="top">Death by overprocessing. The treatment completely killed this for me. It looks like a pretty good shot before you applied all the mumbo-jumbo. I''m not sure why people do this to the images....ahhh well.</td>', 'Death by overprocessing. The treatment completely killed this for me. It looks like a pretty good shot before you applied all the mumbo-jumbo. I''m not sure why people do this to the images....ahhh well.', '2010-07-06 11:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
