(6082335, 895320, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good attempt. Some things that I would suggest: Crop it tighter to remove some of the background people. A little less of the filter that gives it the plastic feel (I''m guessing it''s some type of filter).</td>', 'Good attempt. Some things that I would suggest: Crop it tighter to remove some of the background people. A little less of the filter that gives it the plastic feel (I''m guessing it''s some type of filter).', '2010-07-06 14:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
