(6082338, 895533, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, a nice shot. Some thing that I would suggest: having her move away from the building, and using a shallow depth of field to blur it out of view.</td>', 'Overall, a nice shot. Some thing that I would suggest: having her move away from the building, and using a shallow depth of field to blur it out of view.', '2010-07-06 14:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
