(6085971, 895465, 109227, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot. For me, the crop is a little tight but this does not deminish the photo.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot. For me, the crop is a little tight but this does not deminish the photo.', '2010-07-08 23:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086239, 895312, 47470, '<td valign="top">For portraiture, the subject is usually award that his or her photo is being taken.  Here, it doesn''t look like Joe knows he is being photographed.  It looks candid, which the details of this challenge specifically say not to do.  This really could have been a great image if the subject was engaged.  The lighting could be improved, but the contrasting colors and the potential for the broom to be used as a leading line make me think this could have been a wonderful portrait.  Don''t be afraid to get close to your subject!  He might say no, but he might say yes.  Either way, he won''t bite ; )</td>', 'For portraiture, the subject is usually award that his or her photo is being taken.  Here, it doesn''t look like Joe knows he is being photographed.  It looks candid, which the details of this challenge specifically say not to do.  This really could have been a great image if the subject was engaged.  The lighting could be improved, but the contrasting colors and the potential for the broom to be used as a leading line make me think this could have been a wonderful portrait.  Don''t be afraid to get close to your subject!  He might say no, but he might say yes.  Either way, he won''t bite ; )', '2010-07-09 07:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086240, 895627, 47470, '<td valign="top">The detail in this image is wonderful, but I wish you had brightened his skin tone so it wouldn''t be the same shade at the canvas behind him.  His shirt also blends in with the food behind him.  The overall contrast of this image is pretty good, but the contrast between the subject and the background is not there.</td>', 'The detail in this image is wonderful, but I wish you had brightened his skin tone so it wouldn''t be the same shade at the canvas behind him.  His shirt also blends in with the food behind him.  The overall contrast of this image is pretty good, but the contrast between the subject and the background is not there.', '2010-07-09 07:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086241, 895569, 47470, '<td valign="top">The colors are perfect.  The light on her hair is beautiful too, but I wish you had bounced a bit of light into her face to get a catchlight in her eyes.</td>', 'The colors are perfect.  The light on her hair is beautiful too, but I wish you had bounced a bit of light into her face to get a catchlight in her eyes.', '2010-07-09 07:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086242, 895465, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice  portrait, good detail.</td>', 'Nice  portrait, good detail.', '2010-07-09 07:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086243, 894485, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the angle on this.</td>', 'I like the angle on this.', '2010-07-09 07:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086244, 895609, 47470, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would have eliminated some of the distractions in the background.  Also, be careful about having background elements growing out of the subject''s head.</td>', 'A tighter crop would have eliminated some of the distractions in the background.  Also, be careful about having background elements growing out of the subject''s head.', '2010-07-09 07:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086249, 895384, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love all the elements in this image, from the apron to the shelves in the background.  I''m glad you used a fairly large DOF because all of those little details help create a wonderful atmosphere.  The only thing I would like to see is a little bit more sharpening to bring out the detail in his face.</td>', 'I love all the elements in this image, from the apron to the shelves in the background.  I''m glad you used a fairly large DOF because all of those little details help create a wonderful atmosphere.  The only thing I would like to see is a little bit more sharpening to bring out the detail in his face.', '2010-07-09 07:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086251, 895415, 47470, '<td valign="top">In portraits, the subject is usually engaged with the viewer.  She does not look like she even knows you''re there.</td>', 'In portraits, the subject is usually engaged with the viewer.  She does not look like she even knows you''re there.', '2010-07-09 07:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086254, 895432, 47470, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful character!  I also love the quality of the bokeh.  The background leaves just a hint of the environment, and I think it is the perfect amount of a hint.  Very well balanced contrast as well!</td>', 'What a wonderful character!  I also love the quality of the bokeh.  The background leaves just a hint of the environment, and I think it is the perfect amount of a hint.  Very well balanced contrast as well!', '2010-07-09 07:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086258, 895674, 47470, '<td valign="top">She has such beautiful eyes that I''m sad to see one of them blurred like that.  It makes her face look unsymmetrical, which seems strange.  She has beautiful skin, but since this is an advanced editing, you could have done just a little bit of spot editing to make her look absolutely flawless, which is usually a desirable element in a portrait, especially of a girl in her age bracket.  That said, this is still a nice portrait.</td>', 'She has such beautiful eyes that I''m sad to see one of them blurred like that.  It makes her face look unsymmetrical, which seems strange.  She has beautiful skin, but since this is an advanced editing, you could have done just a little bit of spot editing to make her look absolutely flawless, which is usually a desirable element in a portrait, especially of a girl in her age bracket.  That said, this is still a nice portrait.', '2010-07-09 07:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086259, 895103, 7786, '<td valign="top">Even though this is a very good portrait I dont feel like it is a street portrait. There is nothing in it that gives me the feeling that this is taken on a street or other public domain.</td>', 'Even though this is a very good portrait I dont feel like it is a street portrait. There is nothing in it that gives me the feeling that this is taken on a street or other public domain.', '2010-07-09 07:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086264, 895386, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great balance between the highlight and the shadows on his face!  The expression is also perfectly in character, which helps make this image.</td>', 'Great balance between the highlight and the shadows on his face!  The expression is also perfectly in character, which helps make this image.', '2010-07-09 08:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086270, 895541, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a candid shot, not a formal portrait.  Because of that, both girls are in awkward positions since they are mid-stride.  The light in this area is beautiful, but with such a deep depth of field and lots of crisp words, the girls must compete within the frame with all of these other elements.</td>', 'This is a candid shot, not a formal portrait.  Because of that, both girls are in awkward positions since they are mid-stride.  The light in this area is beautiful, but with such a deep depth of field and lots of crisp words, the girls must compete within the frame with all of these other elements.', '2010-07-09 08:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086273, 895458, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait.  I''m sure he''ll love it!  But it looks like the blue is too saturated, particularly in his skin.</td>', 'This is a great portrait.  I''m sure he''ll love it!  But it looks like the blue is too saturated, particularly in his skin.', '2010-07-09 08:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086279, 895550, 47470, '<td valign="top">The white balance looks a little off.  There is a heavy cyan tinge to the image.  If the image were to have any type of color cast, I think yellow-orange would work best because it would fit with the "old time" feel of the image.  I would have also loved to see a tighter crop on the lady to the right.  She looks like she is very proud of her work and loves to play the part!</td>', 'The white balance looks a little off.  There is a heavy cyan tinge to the image.  If the image were to have any type of color cast, I think yellow-orange would work best because it would fit with the "old time" feel of the image.  I would have also loved to see a tighter crop on the lady to the right.  She looks like she is very proud of her work and loves to play the part!', '2010-07-09 08:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086280, 895419, 47470, '<td valign="top">Is that really natural light?  If so, you found an absolutely perfect convergence of natural light, one of the best I''ve ever seen.  The subject isn''t looking at the camera, but this still makes a gorgeous portrait.  What a wonderful expression!  And I''m still drooling over the light.</td>', 'Is that really natural light?  If so, you found an absolutely perfect convergence of natural light, one of the best I''ve ever seen.  The subject isn''t looking at the camera, but this still makes a gorgeous portrait.  What a wonderful expression!  And I''m still drooling over the light.', '2010-07-09 08:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086281, 895613, 47470, '<td valign="top">Placing a bright reflective card just outside the frame would put a lovely catchlight in his eyes and make this image pop.</td>', 'Placing a bright reflective card just outside the frame would put a lovely catchlight in his eyes and make this image pop.', '2010-07-09 08:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086282, 895484, 47470, '<td valign="top">The blue in this image looks much too saturated, particularly where is shows up in the skin on the right side of the image.</td>', 'The blue in this image looks much too saturated, particularly where is shows up in the skin on the right side of the image.', '2010-07-09 08:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086284, 895565, 102982, '<td valign="top">Fantastic character capture.</td>', 'Fantastic character capture.', '2010-07-09 08:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086287, 895670, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great perspective with a fun subject, but I wish the guys were a little bigger in the frame.  Still, cool image!  The detail in the wood is beautiful!</td>', 'Great perspective with a fun subject, but I wish the guys were a little bigger in the frame.  Still, cool image!  The detail in the wood is beautiful!', '2010-07-09 09:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086289, 895230, 47470, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a statement.  The inclusion of the pin-up girl is very interesting.  I really hope you have some notes on this image in the "Photographer''s Comments" section!  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow, what a statement.  The inclusion of the pin-up girl is very interesting.  I really hope you have some notes on this image in the "Photographer''s Comments" section!  Great shot!', '2010-07-09 09:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086290, 895565, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is such a great expression, but including the horses next to him would have added some context, which would help tell a story about such an interesting character.</td>', 'This is such a great expression, but including the horses next to him would have added some context, which would help tell a story about such an interesting character.', '2010-07-09 09:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086292, 894726, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great light.  The grungy, semi-desaturated look works well, and I''m glad you didn''t over-do it.</td>', 'Great light.  The grungy, semi-desaturated look works well, and I''m glad you didn''t over-do it.', '2010-07-09 09:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086293, 895103, 47470, '<td valign="top">The quality of light here is stunning.  Great composition too.  I only wish you had cleaned up the crumbs on the face to made this look a bit cleaner.</td>', 'The quality of light here is stunning.  Great composition too.  I only wish you had cleaned up the crumbs on the face to made this look a bit cleaner.', '2010-07-09 09:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086296, 895435, 47470, '<td valign="top">I have an inkling that this shot was set up, but it tells such a warm story, that I wouldn''t care anyway.  And what a perfect example of an owner looking like the pet : )  The only thing I would change is the crop.  Removing the geometric shapes (especially the circle) on the left would help keep the focus of the image on the woman and her dog.</td>', 'I have an inkling that this shot was set up, but it tells such a warm story, that I wouldn''t care anyway.  And what a perfect example of an owner looking like the pet : )  The only thing I would change is the crop.  Removing the geometric shapes (especially the circle) on the left would help keep the focus of the image on the woman and her dog.', '2010-07-09 09:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086302, 895403, 47470, '<td valign="top">Between the angle of the camera and the expression on his face, there is a lot of tension in this image.  That tension makes this photo memorable, but I half wish the mood was much calmer, especially since using a potter''s wheel is most often associated with relaxed feelings.  A wonderful shot, nonetheless.</td>', 'Between the angle of the camera and the expression on his face, there is a lot of tension in this image.  That tension makes this photo memorable, but I half wish the mood was much calmer, especially since using a potter''s wheel is most often associated with relaxed feelings.  A wonderful shot, nonetheless.', '2010-07-09 09:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086306, 895650, 47470, '<td valign="top">If you turned them towards their right, the sun wouldn''t fall on their faces.  It would fall on their hair, which would create a nice hair light, leaving beautiful, soft shade on their faces.</td>', 'If you turned them towards their right, the sun wouldn''t fall on their faces.  It would fall on their hair, which would create a nice hair light, leaving beautiful, soft shade on their faces.', '2010-07-09 09:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086327, 895403, 119306, '<td valign="top">Strong composition, and capture his experssion really well.</td>', 'Strong composition, and capture his experssion really well.', '2010-07-09 10:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086449, 895518, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. He''s a very photogenic person.</td>', 'Nice shot. He''s a very photogenic person.', '2010-07-09 13:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086450, 895432, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot and the processing. Very nice job.  Excellent job on the background.</td>', 'I really like the shot and the processing. Very nice job.  Excellent job on the background.', '2010-07-09 13:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086454, 895508, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Gotta love that makeup.</td>', 'Very cool. Gotta love that makeup.', '2010-07-09 13:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086545, 895624, 16241, '<td valign="top">best on show,, no vote.</td>', 'best on show,, no vote.', '2010-07-09 15:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086695, 895236, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Nothing around him is growing or blossoming quite like his beard.</td>', 'Excellent. Nothing around him is growing or blossoming quite like his beard.', '2010-07-09 18:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086700, 895493, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very good, especially with the slight motion blur. My eye tends to follow his arm. I wonder if it''s relaxing, or if he''s holding something or is otherwise occupied.</td>', 'Very good, especially with the slight motion blur. My eye tends to follow his arm. I wonder if it''s relaxing, or if he''s holding something or is otherwise occupied.', '2010-07-09 18:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086701, 895514, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice. I would have like more DOF. The placement of your subject is good, but not really at the expense of a big sea of blur in the middle.</td>', 'Nice. I would have like more DOF. The placement of your subject is good, but not really at the expense of a big sea of blur in the middle.', '2010-07-09 18:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086702, 895303, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. Very intimate. The processing is overdone. His face is nicely textured and tells a story. I''m not sure it need to be puffed up or enhanced any.</td>', 'Nice close up. Very intimate. The processing is overdone. His face is nicely textured and tells a story. I''m not sure it need to be puffed up or enhanced any.', '2010-07-09 18:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086703, 895419, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quite good. The reflection of light looks like a teardrop -- made more effective by the low key treatment.</td>', 'Quite good. The reflection of light looks like a teardrop -- made more effective by the low key treatment.', '2010-07-09 18:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086704, 895385, 76335, '<td valign="top">Her hair and collar and placement in the frame makes me feel some real gravity in this. Wonderful.</td>', 'Her hair and collar and placement in the frame makes me feel some real gravity in this. Wonderful.', '2010-07-09 18:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086705, 895465, 76335, '<td valign="top">Her smile, her teeth especially, nicely echo her scarf and jewelry. This has a lot of warmth -- even in black and white. (The Whoopi comparison was unnecessary.)</td>', 'Her smile, her teeth especially, nicely echo her scarf and jewelry. This has a lot of warmth -- even in black and white. (The Whoopi comparison was unnecessary.)', '2010-07-09 18:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086707, 895550, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Ideally a powerful flash to give some fill light to their faces would have helped.</td>', 'Interesting. Ideally a powerful flash to give some fill light to their faces would have helped.', '2010-07-09 18:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086708, 895526, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice. As you say he''s a dancer, I would like to have seen more of his shoulders. Could be sharper too.</td>', 'Nice. As you say he''s a dancer, I would like to have seen more of his shoulders. Could be sharper too.', '2010-07-09 18:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086712, 895484, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do love this. It''s unapolegtically real. What I don''t like is the slight halo or glow behind the child''s head (most noticeable on the right side).</td>', 'I do love this. It''s unapolegtically real. What I don''t like is the slight halo or glow behind the child''s head (most noticeable on the right side).', '2010-07-09 18:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086713, 895533, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The cool green background does a lot to accentuate her skin tones.</td>', 'Nicely done. The cool green background does a lot to accentuate her skin tones.', '2010-07-09 18:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086717, 895628, 76335, '<td valign="top">Drive by street portrait? It works, I guess, but I wonder what''s in the bag.</td>', 'Drive by street portrait? It works, I guess, but I wonder what''s in the bag.', '2010-07-09 18:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086718, 895483, 76335, '<td valign="top">Artistic -- maybe a little overdone. His left eye looks like it''s had a bit too much doctoring...</td>', 'Artistic -- maybe a little overdone. His left eye looks like it''s had a bit too much doctoring...', '2010-07-09 18:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086719, 895485, 76335, '<td valign="top">Casual and full of friendliness. Dave looks like a swell guy.</td>', 'Casual and full of friendliness. Dave looks like a swell guy.', '2010-07-09 18:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086720, 895631, 76335, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a piercing gaze. What did you say to her?</td>', 'That''s quite a piercing gaze. What did you say to her?', '2010-07-09 18:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086891, 895680, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very good. Almost too good to be believable. (Was this really a complete and total stranger?) I''ll be curious to read the story behind this one.</td>', 'Very good. Almost too good to be believable. (Was this really a complete and total stranger?) I''ll be curious to read the story behind this one.', '2010-07-09 22:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086894, 895674, 76335, '<td valign="top">Up close and personal. I like that. I''m a little bugged by her right eye (viewer''s left) being out of focus.</td>', 'Up close and personal. I like that. I''m a little bugged by her right eye (viewer''s left) being out of focus.', '2010-07-09 22:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086896, 894219, 76335, '<td valign="top">A good portrait. I like the low point of view. The skin tones are very cold though.</td>', 'A good portrait. I like the low point of view. The skin tones are very cold though.', '2010-07-09 22:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086901, 895408, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great job posing your subject (or maybe he did this on his own). I don''t care for the vignette -- not sure it''s needed. But that quibble aside, it''s quite an animated portrait.</td>', 'Great job posing your subject (or maybe he did this on his own). I don''t care for the vignette -- not sure it''s needed. But that quibble aside, it''s quite an animated portrait.', '2010-07-09 22:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086904, 895452, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is good, but it could easily be candid. I think simply having your subject turn his head toward the camera momentarily, while not interrupting what he''s doing, would have been more effective and relevant to the challenge.</td>', 'This is good, but it could easily be candid. I think simply having your subject turn his head toward the camera momentarily, while not interrupting what he''s doing, would have been more effective and relevant to the challenge.', '2010-07-09 22:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086906, 895537, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is good. Lighting feels a bit harsh though.</td>', 'This is good. Lighting feels a bit harsh though.', '2010-07-09 22:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086907, 895458, 76335, '<td valign="top">He looks satisfied and victorious. Quite good.</td>', 'He looks satisfied and victorious. Quite good.', '2010-07-09 22:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6086925, 895105, 76335, '<td valign="top">He does indeed appear to be basking in the afterglow of a good meal. Maybe even some wine. Nice idea.</td>', 'He does indeed appear to be basking in the afterglow of a good meal. Maybe even some wine. Nice idea.', '2010-07-09 22:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087068, 895675, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quality leaves a little something to be desired. The puckered lips make me wonder what''s on his mind.</td>', 'Quality leaves a little something to be desired. The puckered lips make me wonder what''s on his mind.', '2010-07-10 00:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087071, 895039, 76335, '<td valign="top">The processing is a little over the top, but I do like the idea and composition. I wish we could see more of Jim''s face.</td>', 'The processing is a little over the top, but I do like the idea and composition. I wish we could see more of Jim''s face.', '2010-07-10 00:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087074, 895488, 76335, '<td valign="top">The fold of his hat, the wandering eye, and tight framing from a somewhat odd angle make for a disorienting but interesting portrait.</td>', 'The fold of his hat, the wandering eye, and tight framing from a somewhat odd angle make for a disorienting but interesting portrait.', '2010-07-10 00:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087076, 895665, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quite a character you''ve found in Rafa! The beads in the background were a good idea.</td>', 'Quite a character you''ve found in Rafa! The beads in the background were a good idea.', '2010-07-10 00:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087079, 895611, 76335, '<td valign="top">A strong portrait. The processing is a little heavy handed, but it''s hard to resist that smile.</td>', 'A strong portrait. The processing is a little heavy handed, but it''s hard to resist that smile.', '2010-07-10 00:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087080, 895321, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is really good, especially with the blurred background. It troubles me a bit that the frame clips his fingers.</td>', 'This is really good, especially with the blurred background. It troubles me a bit that the frame clips his fingers.', '2010-07-10 00:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087082, 895506, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is a good environmental portrait. Only thing that bothers me a bit is that her face seems more saturated than the rest of the scene. Maybe it''s her skin color and the way it''s lit.</td>', 'This is a good environmental portrait. Only thing that bothers me a bit is that her face seems more saturated than the rest of the scene. Maybe it''s her skin color and the way it''s lit.', '2010-07-10 00:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087083, 895539, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like that we get a further glimpse of the scene from the reflection in his sunglasses.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like that we get a further glimpse of the scene from the reflection in his sunglasses.', '2010-07-10 00:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087106, 895633, 116354, '<td valign="top">What a contrast - congrats on spotting this image.</td>', 'What a contrast - congrats on spotting this image.', '2010-07-10 01:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087108, 895609, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nope, but they look good on him!</td>', 'Nope, but they look good on him!', '2010-07-10 01:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087109, 894107, 54645, '<td valign="top">Good luck! Ha! &lt;no vote&gt;</td>', 'Good luck! Ha! <no vote>', '2010-07-10 01:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087110, 895321, 54645, '<td valign="top">interesting man.</td>', 'interesting man.', '2010-07-10 01:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087112, 895200, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like her expression, some may view her a model. Background is quite enjoyable.</td>', 'I like her expression, some may view her a model. Background is quite enjoyable.', '2010-07-10 01:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087113, 895458, 54645, '<td valign="top">Healthy looking fellow!</td>', 'Healthy looking fellow!', '2010-07-10 01:43:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6087118, 895673, 54645, '<td valign="top">Fantastic scene, very engaging.</td>', 'Fantastic scene, very engaging.', '2010-07-10 01:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087144, 895610, 54645, '<td valign="top">Love the laptop!</td>', 'Love the laptop!', '2010-07-10 02:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087148, 894726, 54645, '<td valign="top">This guy has some serious energy about him. You think you should be wary, but not really, there is a sense of humor in that gaze. Fantastic.</td>', 'This guy has some serious energy about him. You think you should be wary, but not really, there is a sense of humor in that gaze. Fantastic.', '2010-07-10 02:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087165, 895223, 47470, '<td valign="top">His costume is very well done, but being able to see the cars in the background take away the "suspension of disbelief."  There is also a little too much blue/cyan in his skin.  You can correct that by changing the white balance or by using the separate channels of the curves function.</td>', 'His costume is very well done, but being able to see the cars in the background take away the "suspension of disbelief."  There is also a little too much blue/cyan in his skin.  You can correct that by changing the white balance or by using the separate channels of the curves function.', '2010-07-10 04:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087166, 895403, 52765, '<td valign="top">My only 10</td>', 'My only 10', '2010-07-10 04:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087167, 895628, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like having the car window and the man both in focus, but I wish the rest of the background had been blurred.  Using auto focus, the camera will focus on the man, putting about a third of the rest of the "critical sharpness" in front of him and the other two thirds behind him.  For a shot like this, you''d have to manually focus so you can set the focus on just the window and the man.  Sharpening this image in post-processing would also help bring out his face, which should be the focus of the image in a portrait.</td>', 'I like having the car window and the man both in focus, but I wish the rest of the background had been blurred.  Using auto focus, the camera will focus on the man, putting about a third of the rest of the "critical sharpness" in front of him and the other two thirds behind him.  For a shot like this, you''d have to manually focus so you can set the focus on just the window and the man.  Sharpening this image in post-processing would also help bring out his face, which should be the focus of the image in a portrait.', '2010-07-10 04:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087168, 895514, 47470, '<td valign="top">This image has potential to look pretty cool, but I think you need to work with the light here a little more.  If the model had turned to her right a little more, the sunlight wouldn''t have fallen on her forehead and chest; it would have just created a hair light and rim light.  You could have bounced a little more light on her front so the rim light wouldn''t be so blown out (but a bounce card would have shown up in her glasses--you''d have to deiced if you are ok with that or if she should remove the glasses).  If you had also shot from a little higher, you could have cropped out the sky, which is one of the brightest spots in the image, so it pulls too much attention.<br/> <br/>I know this comment is really long, but that doesn''t mean you image is bad.  I thing you did a lot of things right too.  I like that the pinkish-purple of her shirt contrasts well with the green background.  The depth of field is spot-on too; just deep enough for her to be completely in focus, but shallow enough to blur the background out too.</td>', 'This image has potential to look pretty cool, but I think you need to work with the light here a little more.  If the model had turned to her right a little more, the sunlight wouldn''t have fallen on her forehead and chest; it would have just created a hair light and rim light.  You could have bounced a little more light on her front so the rim light wouldn''t be so blown out (but a bounce card would have shown up in her glasses--you''d have to deiced if you are ok with that or if she should remove the glasses).  If you had also shot from a little higher, you could have cropped out the sky, which is one of the brightest spots in the image, so it pulls too much attention. I know this comment is really long, but that doesn''t mean you image is bad.  I thing you did a lot of things right too.  I like that the pinkish-purple of her shirt contrasts well with the green background.  The depth of field is spot-on too; just deep enough for her to be completely in focus, but shallow enough to blur the background out too.', '2010-07-10 04:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087169, 895359, 47470, '<td valign="top">I generally like the partially desaturated look, but I wish there was the tiniest bit more color in his face so he wouldn''t look so pale.  The angle of his head works well, but I can''t decide if I like the wink or not.</td>', 'I generally like the partially desaturated look, but I wish there was the tiniest bit more color in his face so he wouldn''t look so pale.  The angle of his head works well, but I can''t decide if I like the wink or not.', '2010-07-10 04:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087172, 895303, 47470, '<td valign="top">It looks like you might have done topaz or something to bring out the detail in his face, since his face was in shade.  I think you balanced the bright parts of the image and the shade on his face very well, but all the detail in his skin makes him look much older than he probably is.  That could be interpreted as negative, which I''m guessing you probably didn''t intent (based on the title).  There is also something bouncing light on his face from below (maybe even the ground?).  Lighting from below is called "monster lighting" (no, I didn''t make up that name), which also adds to that unintended (or so I assume) negativity in this image.  He has a wonderful face, but I think these two elements that create a negative atmosphere are hurting the image...unless, of course, you intended to do that, in which case it works very well.  I apologize for my bluntness and I hope I didn''t offend you.</td>', 'It looks like you might have done topaz or something to bring out the detail in his face, since his face was in shade.  I think you balanced the bright parts of the image and the shade on his face very well, but all the detail in his skin makes him look much older than he probably is.  That could be interpreted as negative, which I''m guessing you probably didn''t intent (based on the title).  There is also something bouncing light on his face from below (maybe even the ground?).  Lighting from below is called "monster lighting" (no, I didn''t make up that name), which also adds to that unintended (or so I assume) negativity in this image.  He has a wonderful face, but I think these two elements that create a negative atmosphere are hurting the image...unless, of course, you intended to do that, in which case it works very well.  I apologize for my bluntness and I hope I didn''t offend you.', '2010-07-10 04:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087174, 895513, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is a little too tight.  I don''t mind missing the side of his face, but cutting him off at the neck kinda looks like he''s been beheaded!  Putting a white or reflective card just out of the frame would have added a nice catchlight in his eyes, which would make this photo pop.</td>', 'I think the crop is a little too tight.  I don''t mind missing the side of his face, but cutting him off at the neck kinda looks like he''s been beheaded!  Putting a white or reflective card just out of the frame would have added a nice catchlight in his eyes, which would make this photo pop.', '2010-07-10 04:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087176, 895479, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo, but the light isn''t so great.  It''s direct sunlight coming from above, which makes harsh shadows in her eyes.  The eyes are usually the focus in a portrait, so you don''t want them to be so dark.  Shooting early in the morning or later in the afternoon would have better light.<br/> <br/>I also don''t think the black and white helps this.  She''s young, smiling, playful, carrying a balloon, and wearing a bathing suit.  Color and vibrancy would have better fit the mood of the image.</td>', 'This is a cute photo, but the light isn''t so great.  It''s direct sunlight coming from above, which makes harsh shadows in her eyes.  The eyes are usually the focus in a portrait, so you don''t want them to be so dark.  Shooting early in the morning or later in the afternoon would have better light. I also don''t think the black and white helps this.  She''s young, smiling, playful, carrying a balloon, and wearing a bathing suit.  Color and vibrancy would have better fit the mood of the image.', '2010-07-10 04:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087177, 894107, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, but I''m guessing it''s getting hammered.  You should have entered this in the free study instead.  Don''t be afraid to photograph people!  They don''t bite!<br/>(Not voting.)</td>', 'This is a great image, but I''m guessing it''s getting hammered.  You should have entered this in the free study instead.  Don''t be afraid to photograph people!  They don''t bite!(Not voting.)', '2010-07-10 04:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087179, 894595, 47470, '<td valign="top">This image looks tone mapped/topazed, which definitely helps balance the spots of bright sunlight with the shadows, but I think this brought out too much detail in his skin, making him look much older and dirtier.  I''m not sure that is terribly nice to make someone look like that.  The sign and any other elements in the image should be able to convey his situation without the added "dirt" of post-processing.</td>', 'This image looks tone mapped/topazed, which definitely helps balance the spots of bright sunlight with the shadows, but I think this brought out too much detail in his skin, making him look much older and dirtier.  I''m not sure that is terribly nice to make someone look like that.  The sign and any other elements in the image should be able to convey his situation without the added "dirt" of post-processing.', '2010-07-10 04:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087183, 895650, 61084, '<td valign="top">You sure it''s not Jenny and Craig? :P</td>', 'You sure it''s not Jenny and Craig? :P', '2010-07-10 05:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087186, 895488, 61084, '<td valign="top">Poor Martin Lawrence. Can''t get any recent movie work, and now he has to sell peanuts on the street! :(</td>', 'Poor Martin Lawrence. Can''t get any recent movie work, and now he has to sell peanuts on the street! :(', '2010-07-10 05:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087187, 895518, 61084, '<td valign="top">You sure this isn''t a wax figure with a hat and coat on? Looks like one to me.</td>', 'You sure this isn''t a wax figure with a hat and coat on? Looks like one to me.', '2010-07-10 05:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087189, 895415, 61084, '<td valign="top">This is a candid...not a portrait.</td>', 'This is a candid...not a portrait.', '2010-07-10 05:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087194, 895668, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had brightened this a little.  There are no whites in this image.  The brightest parts are actually light gray.  I''d like to see the white of his beard and the white of his headband a bit lighter.  That would help put more focus on his face.</td>', 'I wish you had brightened this a little.  There are no whites in this image.  The brightest parts are actually light gray.  I''d like to see the white of his beard and the white of his headband a bit lighter.  That would help put more focus on his face.', '2010-07-10 07:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087197, 894726, 100831, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Spot on for the topic, in my opinion. Direct, yet not too close. Love it.</td>', 'Excellent. Spot on for the topic, in my opinion. Direct, yet not too close. Love it.', '2010-07-10 07:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087198, 895465, 100831, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous look. Beautiful eyes. Excellent</td>', 'Gorgeous look. Beautiful eyes. Excellent', '2010-07-10 07:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087200, 895565, 100831, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the beard - and the twinkle in his eyes.</td>', 'Gotta love the beard - and the twinkle in his eyes.', '2010-07-10 07:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087201, 895517, 100831, '<td valign="top">You know you captured the face well. IMHO, a crop would have worked out nicely.</td>', 'You know you captured the face well. IMHO, a crop would have worked out nicely.', '2010-07-10 07:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087202, 895631, 100831, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I would rather have the eyes looking forward. Gorgeous capture. Love the composition.</td>', 'I can''t decide if I would rather have the eyes looking forward. Gorgeous capture. Love the composition.', '2010-07-10 07:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087203, 895200, 100831, '<td valign="top">stunning.</td>', 'stunning.', '2010-07-10 07:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087204, 895386, 100831, '<td valign="top">geez, the eyes are scary (in a chuckle sort of way)... great colors and a very nice casual type portrait.</td>', 'geez, the eyes are scary (in a chuckle sort of way)... great colors and a very nice casual type portrait.', '2010-07-10 07:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087205, 895403, 100831, '<td valign="top">love it. The eyes are terrific, as is the rest of te capture.</td>', 'love it. The eyes are terrific, as is the rest of te capture.', '2010-07-10 07:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087211, 895665, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light looks very flat.  There isn''t even a shadow under his chin.  The beads behind him are slightly distracting since they are so detailed, and they also contrast too much against his expression.</td>', 'The light looks very flat.  There isn''t even a shadow under his chin.  The beads behind him are slightly distracting since they are so detailed, and they also contrast too much against his expression.', '2010-07-10 08:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087213, 895676, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice balance between the bright sun and the shade.  I wish the white keys of the accordion were closer to white (they are light grey here).  Some more space above his head would also balance out the space taken up by the accordion on the bottom.</td>', 'Nice balance between the bright sun and the shade.  I wish the white keys of the accordion were closer to white (they are light grey here).  Some more space above his head would also balance out the space taken up by the accordion on the bottom.', '2010-07-10 08:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087324, 895223, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very convincing. I do indeed get the feeling that he just stepped out of a time machine. The casual pose and all the period garb work well.</td>', 'Very convincing. I do indeed get the feeling that he just stepped out of a time machine. The casual pose and all the period garb work well.', '2010-07-10 11:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087325, 895517, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the product placement or what you''re suggesting with that. I do like the long vertical frame and leading lines.</td>', 'Not sure about the product placement or what you''re suggesting with that. I do like the long vertical frame and leading lines.', '2010-07-10 11:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087327, 895541, 76335, '<td valign="top">As a casual street snap, this has some interesting things going on. But this feels too candid to be considered a street portrait. And the telehpoto lens doesn''t help in that respect.</td>', 'As a casual street snap, this has some interesting things going on. But this feels too candid to be considered a street portrait. And the telehpoto lens doesn''t help in that respect.', '2010-07-10 11:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087330, 895676, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing of your subject and his instrument. From the expression on his face, I get the feeling that he''s playing a love song -- or a sad song.</td>', 'Very nice framing of your subject and his instrument. From the expression on his face, I get the feeling that he''s playing a love song -- or a sad song.', '2010-07-10 11:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087336, 895610, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quite a character study! I''m on the fence about the laptop, if we should see less (or none) of it -- or slightly more.</td>', 'Quite a character study! I''m on the fence about the laptop, if we should see less (or none) of it -- or slightly more.', '2010-07-10 11:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087339, 895565, 76335, '<td valign="top">The tight framing really works. I get the feeling of being eye to eye with him. Not crazy about the processing, but your subject is so irresistable, that I feel I can overlook it.</td>', 'The tight framing really works. I get the feeling of being eye to eye with him. Not crazy about the processing, but your subject is so irresistable, that I feel I can overlook it.', '2010-07-10 12:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087358, 895540, 76335, '<td valign="top">Colorful on so many levels... Great title too.</td>', 'Colorful on so many levels... Great title too.', '2010-07-10 12:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087367, 895386, 76335, '<td valign="top">The man in the costume alone would have made a great portrait. But the ridculous expression on his face nails it.</td>', 'The man in the costume alone would have made a great portrait. But the ridculous expression on his face nails it.', '2010-07-10 12:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087374, 895479, 76335, '<td valign="top">Casual and fun. I love all the textures -- especially effective since you chose to do this in black and white. Maybe a bit too sharp though.</td>', 'Casual and fun. I love all the textures -- especially effective since you chose to do this in black and white. Maybe a bit too sharp though.', '2010-07-10 12:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087379, 895332, 76335, '<td valign="top">They look like a fun loving and dedicated bunch. The processing, however, leaves a lot to be desired.</td>', 'They look like a fun loving and dedicated bunch. The processing, however, leaves a lot to be desired.', '2010-07-10 12:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087386, 895613, 76335, '<td valign="top">Cool and casual and very nice in black and white. He''s obviously very comfortable with you and the camera. Nice job.</td>', 'Cool and casual and very nice in black and white. He''s obviously very comfortable with you and the camera. Nice job.', '2010-07-10 13:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087388, 894485, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like the lighting (any more, though, would have been too much). I also like the softness of it, and the tilt adds an intersting dynamic.</td>', 'I do like the lighting (any more, though, would have been too much). I also like the softness of it, and the tilt adds an intersting dynamic.', '2010-07-10 13:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087390, 895359, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the cool muted tones, and shallow DOF focusing on one eye. The pose is excellent.</td>', 'I like the cool muted tones, and shallow DOF focusing on one eye. The pose is excellent.', '2010-07-10 13:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087391, 895510, 76335, '<td valign="top">A man and his sweetheart. I kind of wish maybe you had gotten closer and captured some of his reflection in the hood. Still very nice. (Not crazy about the processing though.)</td>', 'A man and his sweetheart. I kind of wish maybe you had gotten closer and captured some of his reflection in the hood. Still very nice. (Not crazy about the processing though.)', '2010-07-10 13:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087395, 895625, 76335, '<td valign="top">The lighting is harsh but somehow seems relevant -- the way it carves those sharp shadows right through him. It seems fitting to his costume.</td>', 'The lighting is harsh but somehow seems relevant -- the way it carves those sharp shadows right through him. It seems fitting to his costume.', '2010-07-10 13:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087398, 895476, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the environmental framing. It seems to lack some needed texture though. Also, I''m unsure about the backlighting (you probably didn''t have much control over that though).</td>', 'I like the environmental framing. It seems to lack some needed texture though. Also, I''m unsure about the backlighting (you probably didn''t have much control over that though).', '2010-07-10 13:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087399, 895535, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the high spirits of this, and the textures and colors are all great. The processing doesn''t really suit me though.</td>', 'I love the high spirits of this, and the textures and colors are all great. The processing doesn''t really suit me though.', '2010-07-10 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087437, 895517, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the back-lighting and the color composition. The crop appears initially a bit rough, but works with the "pillar" in the background. The title also appears a bit rough, but unfortunately I couldn''t find anything to make it work for me. (not voting)</td>', 'I like the back-lighting and the color composition. The crop appears initially a bit rough, but works with the "pillar" in the background. The title also appears a bit rough, but unfortunately I couldn''t find anything to make it work for me. (not voting)', '2010-07-10 14:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087439, 895415, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the carefree feeling of this and the soft treatment and muted colors. Kind of wish her arm weren''t eclipsing her face. Just a glimpse of profile would have been nice...</td>', 'I like the carefree feeling of this and the soft treatment and muted colors. Kind of wish her arm weren''t eclipsing her face. Just a glimpse of profile would have been nice...', '2010-07-10 14:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087442, 895518, 76335, '<td valign="top">A very intense portrait. It''s almost painful to look at him, though that''s kind of cowardly, as the pain is clearly his own. <br/> <br/>As an aside, it seems a bit too sharp. It''s a minor point though, as otherwise it''s a very strong statement.</td>', 'A very intense portrait. It''s almost painful to look at him, though that''s kind of cowardly, as the pain is clearly his own.  As an aside, it seems a bit too sharp. It''s a minor point though, as otherwise it''s a very strong statement.', '2010-07-10 14:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087447, 895432, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great expression, tones, focus and background. For me, the interplay of the hat and the ship mast in background is the cherry on top of the cake. (not voting)</td>', 'Great expression, tones, focus and background. For me, the interplay of the hat and the ship mast in background is the cherry on top of the cake. (not voting)', '2010-07-10 14:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087449, 895403, 61396, '<td valign="top">I especially like the way the colors of both potter and pottery merge together. Lighting and angle work great too. (not voting)</td>', 'I especially like the way the colors of both potter and pottery merge together. Lighting and angle work great too. (not voting)', '2010-07-10 14:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087488, 895312, 76335, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that you didn''t engage your subject for this shot. It looks quite candid and it seems as though you''re not very close.</td>', 'I get the feeling that you didn''t engage your subject for this shot. It looks quite candid and it seems as though you''re not very close.', '2010-07-10 16:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087514, 895508, 38162, '<td valign="top">border detracts from a 10.  great capture.</td>', 'border detracts from a 10.  great capture.', '2010-07-10 17:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087518, 895650, 38162, '<td valign="top">windy title detracts.  good capture.</td>', 'windy title detracts.  good capture.', '2010-07-10 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087522, 895216, 38162, '<td valign="top">windy title detracts</td>', 'windy title detracts', '2010-07-10 17:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087666, 895674, 10785, '<td valign="top">She would be fresh if her entire face was in focus. Here it looks like you were shooting at about f1.8 and with such close distance you had maybe less than an inch of depth of field in total...</td>', 'She would be fresh if her entire face was in focus. Here it looks like you were shooting at about f1.8 and with such close distance you had maybe less than an inch of depth of field in total...', '2010-07-10 20:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087693, 895670, 76335, '<td valign="top">Okay, a group portrait. This is pretty cool. At first glance, I thought it might be the same guy in a multi exposure set up. Were these total strangers that you approached and encouraged to perform in this manner? I''ll be interested to read more about it...</td>', 'Okay, a group portrait. This is pretty cool. At first glance, I thought it might be the same guy in a multi exposure set up. Were these total strangers that you approached and encouraged to perform in this manner? I''ll be interested to read more about it...', '2010-07-10 21:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087698, 895384, 76335, '<td valign="top">A good environmental portrait. He''s in uniform and there''s a lot to see in his surroundings. I think you could have gotten a bit closer and not lost anything.</td>', 'A good environmental portrait. He''s in uniform and there''s a lot to see in his surroundings. I think you could have gotten a bit closer and not lost anything.', '2010-07-10 21:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087699, 894107, 76335, '<td valign="top">If you say so. Challenge aside, it''s a great nature shot.</td>', 'If you say so. Challenge aside, it''s a great nature shot.', '2010-07-10 21:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087700, 895609, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! So much geometry to take in here -- not just the glasses, but the shape of his head, the point of his beard, the collar... And the black and white treatment goes a long way to accentuate it.</td>', 'Fabulous! So much geometry to take in here -- not just the glasses, but the shape of his head, the point of his beard, the collar... And the black and white treatment goes a long way to accentuate it.', '2010-07-10 21:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087701, 895627, 76335, '<td valign="top">The face is a bit soft, but overall it works. I like the unique point of view that shows us the fruits of his labor (pun intended). His stance and the expression say a lot too.</td>', 'The face is a bit soft, but overall it works. I like the unique point of view that shows us the fruits of his labor (pun intended). His stance and the expression say a lot too.', '2010-07-10 21:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087703, 895216, 76335, '<td valign="top">Casual and real. No funny stuff in post processing. Very effective in all its simplicity.</td>', 'Casual and real. No funny stuff in post processing. Very effective in all its simplicity.', '2010-07-10 21:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087705, 895569, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful. Purple everywhere. One minor quibble is that her expression looks a bit tense, forced maybe. Catching her in a more relaxed moment would have helped. <br/> <br/>Overall, very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful. Purple everywhere. One minor quibble is that her expression looks a bit tense, forced maybe. Catching her in a more relaxed moment would have helped.  Overall, very nice.', '2010-07-10 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087712, 895608, 76335, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject and an engaging pose. The quality is lacking though. The lighting is kind of flat, and it looks like you''ve overapplied noise reduction.</td>', 'An interesting subject and an engaging pose. The quality is lacking though. The lighting is kind of flat, and it looks like you''ve overapplied noise reduction.', '2010-07-10 21:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087715, 894595, 76335, '<td valign="top">Remarkable indeed. Bill clearly has a lot of stories to tell. There''s so much to take in here and the image is bursting with texture and details. For that reason, the heavy handed processing was unnecessary. It''s a busy enough image as it is, and I don''t think the Topaz-like treatment was needed at all. (But I have a feeling I''m in the minority on that.)</td>', 'Remarkable indeed. Bill clearly has a lot of stories to tell. There''s so much to take in here and the image is bursting with texture and details. For that reason, the heavy handed processing was unnecessary. It''s a busy enough image as it is, and I don''t think the Topaz-like treatment was needed at all. (But I have a feeling I''m in the minority on that.)', '2010-07-10 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087716, 895673, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is a very intimate portrait, not just of a child but of a relationship (presumably father and son). I appreciate the soft black and white treatment. It''s also a welcome diversion from a challenge full of working folk and homeless people.</td>', 'This is a very intimate portrait, not just of a child but of a relationship (presumably father and son). I appreciate the soft black and white treatment. It''s also a welcome diversion from a challenge full of working folk and homeless people.', '2010-07-10 21:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087719, 895650, 76335, '<td valign="top">What it lacks in intrigue it makes up for in its honesty. They look like a happy couple.</td>', 'What it lacks in intrigue it makes up for in its honesty. They look like a happy couple.', '2010-07-10 21:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087722, 895672, 76335, '<td valign="top">This makes me laugh. Great idea. I kind of wish the background were less busy -- maybe you could have posed them elsewhere. It''s a minor point.</td>', 'This makes me laugh. Great idea. I kind of wish the background were less busy -- maybe you could have posed them elsewhere. It''s a minor point.', '2010-07-10 22:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087800, 895403, 25313, '<td valign="top">a perfect 10!</td>', 'a perfect 10!', '2010-07-11 00:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087807, 895206, 25313, '<td valign="top">the high contrast works...what a smile! 8</td>', 'the high contrast works...what a smile! 8', '2010-07-11 00:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087809, 895103, 25313, '<td valign="top">extremely engaging ...9</td>', 'extremely engaging ...9', '2010-07-11 00:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6087811, 895565, 25313, '<td valign="top">to me a close-up under these conditions are more candid than formal...that is a small detail none the less. 8</td>', 'to me a close-up under these conditions are more candid than formal...that is a small detail none the less. 8', '2010-07-11 00:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
