(6087848, 895359, 25313, '<td valign="top">the head tilt, yonder gaze, and shallow depth are all very strong...the near blowout on the highlights are somewhat distracting (could be monitor compliance though) 8</td>', 'the head tilt, yonder gaze, and shallow depth are all very strong...the near blowout on the highlights are somewhat distracting (could be monitor compliance though) 8', '2010-07-11 00:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
