(6087852, 895680, 25313, '<td valign="top">the mix of light and pose are perfect...the leg and the highlight above her head are distracting to me...7</td>', 'the mix of light and pose are perfect...the leg and the highlight above her head are distracting to me...7', '2010-07-11 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
