(6088019, 895459, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the casual, relaxed pose. Under other circumstances, the harsh lighting might be too much. But it seems to work with your subject, effectively illuminating the textures in his skin, hair and clothing.</td>', 'I like the casual, relaxed pose. Under other circumstances, the harsh lighting might be too much. But it seems to work with your subject, effectively illuminating the textures in his skin, hair and clothing.', '2010-07-11 11:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088025, 895341, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is good. An outdoor performer comfortable with his instrument, his craft and happy to pose (or just play) for the camera. The tilt and the glimpse of background scenery (a park?) add some nice context.</td>', 'This is good. An outdoor performer comfortable with his instrument, his craft and happy to pose (or just play) for the camera. The tilt and the glimpse of background scenery (a park?) add some nice context.', '2010-07-11 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088027, 895206, 76335, '<td valign="top">The processing might be a bit much. But the smile is infectious.</td>', 'The processing might be a bit much. But the smile is infectious.', '2010-07-11 11:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088030, 895320, 76335, '<td valign="top">The quality here isn''t great. Look like a telephoto or a severe crop. The subjects look happy and relaxed, but the circumstances under which this was taken feel much too casual to call this a street portrait.</td>', 'The quality here isn''t great. Look like a telephoto or a severe crop. The subjects look happy and relaxed, but the circumstances under which this was taken feel much too casual to call this a street portrait.', '2010-07-11 11:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088039, 895435, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is incredible. The high key effect, the expressions, the humor -- it all comes together.</td>', 'This is incredible. The high key effect, the expressions, the humor -- it all comes together.', '2010-07-11 11:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088041, 895403, 76335, '<td valign="top">Most excellent. The lighting and the angle are most effective to show us not only his craft but also his intense face and bony frame.</td>', 'Most excellent. The lighting and the angle are most effective to show us not only his craft but also his intense face and bony frame.', '2010-07-11 11:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088042, 895311, 76335, '<td valign="top">Her face tells a million stories. Most engaging. Good for you.</td>', 'Her face tells a million stories. Most engaging. Good for you.', '2010-07-11 11:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088043, 894726, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like that you''ve stooped down to his level, and got his whole body in the frame.</td>', 'Well done. I like that you''ve stooped down to his level, and got his whole body in the frame.', '2010-07-11 11:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088045, 895300, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very striking. Your title is perfect. The background with the blur and the rails gives this a strong feeling of transience -- as does his slightly wrinkled suit.</td>', 'Very striking. Your title is perfect. The background with the blur and the rails gives this a strong feeling of transience -- as does his slightly wrinkled suit.', '2010-07-11 11:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088046, 895677, 76335, '<td valign="top">A slightly different twist on the challenge, and I think I like it. Less about the face, more about the figure, but not at the cost of losing part of her (?) story. She''s a dog owner, a loner perhaps -- lives by the sea. Nice job.</td>', 'A slightly different twist on the challenge, and I think I like it. Less about the face, more about the figure, but not at the cost of losing part of her (?) story. She''s a dog owner, a loner perhaps -- lives by the sea. Nice job.', '2010-07-11 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088047, 895633, 76335, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine him eating any other color ice cream. This is great! One first sees the ice cream, and then the scratches/scars on his arm and wonders what he''s up to. Maybe it was an accident, or maybe he''s up to something not so benign as enjoying ice cream (in which case the contrast works well). The pattern on his shirt is gravy. Excellent!</td>', 'I can''t imagine him eating any other color ice cream. This is great! One first sees the ice cream, and then the scratches/scars on his arm and wonders what he''s up to. Maybe it was an accident, or maybe he''s up to something not so benign as enjoying ice cream (in which case the contrast works well). The pattern on his shirt is gravy. Excellent!', '2010-07-11 11:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088048, 895578, 76335, '<td valign="top">The viewer first sees her (not so) innocent face, then the patterened shirt which camouflages, only for a split second, her tattooed arm. So there''s an element of surprise while taking this in. Very effective. Great street portrait.</td>', 'The viewer first sees her (not so) innocent face, then the patterened shirt which camouflages, only for a split second, her tattooed arm. So there''s an element of surprise while taking this in. Very effective. Great street portrait.', '2010-07-11 11:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088049, 895528, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the initmacy of this. I especially appreciate the soft treatement in processing. The color is important but muted enough to not steal the show. No funny stuff with contrast or sharpening either. The composition, and by extension your subject, stands on its own. Nicely done. <br/> <br/>(Love the pins too, by the way.)</td>', 'I like the initmacy of this. I especially appreciate the soft treatement in processing. The color is important but muted enough to not steal the show. No funny stuff with contrast or sharpening either. The composition, and by extension your subject, stands on its own. Nicely done.  (Love the pins too, by the way.)', '2010-07-11 11:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088051, 895507, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very engaging. It''s very much about the black jacket and hat, and I''m glad that you chose a dark, muted, mostly colorless background on which to pose Dan. (The revolvoing door adds a little bit of needed, or just welcome, context.) The natural light coming from one side works very well. A most intriguing portrait.</td>', 'Very engaging. It''s very much about the black jacket and hat, and I''m glad that you chose a dark, muted, mostly colorless background on which to pose Dan. (The revolvoing door adds a little bit of needed, or just welcome, context.) The natural light coming from one side works very well. A most intriguing portrait.', '2010-07-11 11:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088052, 895432, 76335, '<td valign="top">The energy of the background is really good and complements his busy hat and sweater quite nicely.</td>', 'The energy of the background is really good and complements his busy hat and sweater quite nicely.', '2010-07-11 11:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088053, 895513, 76335, '<td valign="top">So many subtle things to take in here. And the off center framing is a stroke of genius. Great!</td>', 'So many subtle things to take in here. And the off center framing is a stroke of genius. Great!', '2010-07-11 11:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088054, 895200, 76335, '<td valign="top">If not for you, she was heavily dressed up and made up for someone. Got to be a good story here. This portrait speaks volumes.</td>', 'If not for you, she was heavily dressed up and made up for someone. Got to be a good story here. This portrait speaks volumes.', '2010-07-11 11:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088055, 895508, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent. I''m a sucker for the cross-processed effect. And it works well with your animated subject. The blurred background gives it a magical effect -- like something out of a fairy tale book.</td>', 'Excellent. I''m a sucker for the cross-processed effect. And it works well with your animated subject. The blurred background gives it a magical effect -- like something out of a fairy tale book.', '2010-07-11 11:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
