(6088480, 894219, 25313, '<td valign="top">the beads and stoic confidence of the face tells your story very clearly...the only critic is the desat and lack detail in the eyes, of course my opinion only. 6</td>', 'the beads and stoic confidence of the face tells your story very clearly...the only critic is the desat and lack detail in the eyes, of course my opinion only. 6', '2010-07-11 20:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
