(6088552, 895677, 25313, '<td valign="top">very environmental...the little dog is a nice added touch.</td>', 'very environmental...the little dog is a nice added touch.', '2010-07-11 21:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088553, 894107, 110400, '<td valign="top">This is really flirting the edge of DNMC.  The spirit of the challenge (complete and total stanger(s)) really is not being met in a wildlife shot with no people in it.</td>', 'This is really flirting the edge of DNMC.  The spirit of the challenge (complete and total stanger(s)) really is not being met in a wildlife shot with no people in it.', '2010-07-11 21:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088555, 895432, 25313, '<td valign="top">the background has as much to do about this as the subject. 7</td>', 'the background has as much to do about this as the subject. 7', '2010-07-11 21:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088556, 895565, 110400, '<td valign="top">I love his moustache and beard!  I probably would have tried it in B&amp;W to get a different contrast, but great shot. (7)</td>', 'I love his moustache and beard!  I probably would have tried it in B&W to get a different contrast, but great shot. (7)', '2010-07-11 21:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088557, 895670, 110400, '<td valign="top">The clouds in this shot are great and the scene is pretty cool. (7)</td>', 'The clouds in this shot are great and the scene is pretty cool. (7)', '2010-07-11 21:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088560, 895039, 110400, '<td valign="top">I Like the picture, but not the vignette.</td>', 'I Like the picture, but not the vignette.', '2010-07-11 21:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088562, 895680, 110400, '<td valign="top">You found a complete and total stranger in a conference room who was willing to take this picture?</td>', 'You found a complete and total stranger in a conference room who was willing to take this picture?', '2010-07-11 21:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088563, 895508, 25313, '<td valign="top">out of the box proc but, i like your interpretation. 6 bumped to a 7</td>', 'out of the box proc but, i like your interpretation. 6 bumped to a 7', '2010-07-11 21:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088627, 895438, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is striking. His eyes speak volumes.<br/> <br/>Back for a second look. I''m calling this my pick of the challenge. That piercing gaze, all those textures. This is amazingly good. A ten for you.</td>', 'This is striking. His eyes speak volumes. Back for a second look. I''m calling this my pick of the challenge. That piercing gaze, all those textures. This is amazingly good. A ten for you.', '2010-07-11 22:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088629, 895103, 76335, '<td valign="top">Bold. Captivating. Penetrating.</td>', 'Bold. Captivating. Penetrating.', '2010-07-11 22:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088630, 895519, 76335, '<td valign="top">Easily a top pick from me. A classic street portrait, and most excellent in black and white.</td>', 'Easily a top pick from me. A classic street portrait, and most excellent in black and white.', '2010-07-11 22:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088631, 895624, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the title, and the face is so engaging that it''s almost sinister. The motion and energy of the background makes it feel as though she''s about to be sucked right out of the frame -- back into the night. Great!</td>', 'I love the title, and the face is so engaging that it''s almost sinister. The motion and energy of the background makes it feel as though she''s about to be sucked right out of the frame -- back into the night. Great!', '2010-07-11 22:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088633, 895230, 76335, '<td valign="top">Now how cool is this?! Very effective. I feel like we''re seeing a younger Julie in the glass there.</td>', 'Now how cool is this?! Very effective. I feel like we''re seeing a younger Julie in the glass there.', '2010-07-11 22:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088634, 895616, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant. A top pick from me for sure. The 15 nails it. The fact that he''s wearing vertical pinstripes -- I guess that was luck?</td>', 'This is brilliant. A top pick from me for sure. The 15 nails it. The fact that he''s wearing vertical pinstripes -- I guess that was luck?', '2010-07-11 22:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088635, 895681, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like this. My first impression was that you didn''t pose or engage the subject; it almost looks candid. But I have to give you the benefit of the doubt and guess that you conceived and composed this with your subject''s cooperation. An eight for you.</td>', 'I do like this. My first impression was that you didn''t pose or engage the subject; it almost looks candid. But I have to give you the benefit of the doubt and guess that you conceived and composed this with your subject''s cooperation. An eight for you.', '2010-07-11 22:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088636, 895152, 76335, '<td valign="top">Trying to pick out the Steve (i.e. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=32767" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pawdrix</a>) shot in this challenge. And I think this might be it. If it isn''t, it''s a huge compliment. <br/> <br/>Great character study, this is. The tight framing really works.</td>', 'Trying to pick out the Steve (i.e.  pawdrix) shot in this challenge. And I think this might be it. If it isn''t, it''s a huge compliment.  Great character study, this is. The tight framing really works.', '2010-07-11 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088637, 895601, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very nicely framed. I''m on the fence about entries that have multiple people, but with this, one gets the feeling that it''s all about the figure in the foreground. His companion helps tell his story but doesn''t steal his fire.</td>', 'Very nicely framed. I''m on the fence about entries that have multiple people, but with this, one gets the feeling that it''s all about the figure in the foreground. His companion helps tell his story but doesn''t steal his fire.', '2010-07-11 22:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088715, 895103, 3936, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this image.  He looks like he could burst into laughter at any moment.  He makes me smile.</td>', 'I really enjoy this image.  He looks like he could burst into laughter at any moment.  He makes me smile.', '2010-07-11 23:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088748, 895483, 103032, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of going with the purple tones.  IMHO, I think if you had gone with a sepia treatment, it may work with the grain for an antique look.  Anyways, this popped out for me cuz the guy looks like a modern day Billy the Kid [in New Orleans with the beads :) ]  Good luck with the voting.</td>', 'Interesting choice of going with the purple tones.  IMHO, I think if you had gone with a sepia treatment, it may work with the grain for an antique look.  Anyways, this popped out for me cuz the guy looks like a modern day Billy the Kid [in New Orleans with the beads :) ]  Good luck with the voting.', '2010-07-12 00:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088752, 895674, 54645, '<td valign="top">Hmm, not sure if you noticed this, but her right eye is blurry. ;) Ha!<br/> <br/>She has such a beautiful relaxed smile, and you captured her personality quite well. <br/> <br/>Great work Michelle!</td>', 'Hmm, not sure if you noticed this, but her right eye is blurry. ;) Ha! She has such a beautiful relaxed smile, and you captured her personality quite well.  Great work Michelle!', '2010-07-12 00:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
