(6089260, 894726, 24454, '<td valign="top">Way to go, Steve!  I knew this one would do great. What a whipped expression that guy has.  You''re the best at this kind of photography.  Congratulations on the honorable mention.</td>', 'Way to go, Steve!  I knew this one would do great. What a whipped expression that guy has.  You''re the best at this kind of photography.  Congratulations on the honorable mention.', '2010-07-12 09:37:08.000000', NULL, 0),
