(6089272, 895103, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awww, cherubic is right.  You nailed it!  I loved it as soon as I saw it in the challenge.  And a great story to go with your meeting of such cute new friends.  This is a no-brainer to kick butt in a Street Portrait challenge!</td>', 'Awww, cherubic is right.  You nailed it!  I loved it as soon as I saw it in the challenge.  And a great story to go with your meeting of such cute new friends.  This is a no-brainer to kick butt in a Street Portrait challenge!', '2010-07-12 09:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6089275, 895624, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is amazing!  I love her expression, and the exposure is phenomenal being in such low light.  Congratulations!</td>', 'That is amazing!  I love her expression, and the exposure is phenomenal being in such low light.  Congratulations!', '2010-07-12 09:46:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6089276, 895465, 24454, '<td valign="top">Way to go, Maggie!  I wish you could see her again and tell her how well her picture did.  This is really a good photo of her, I bet she''d love it.  Congratulations on first page honors  :)</td>', 'Way to go, Maggie!  I wish you could see her again and tell her how well her picture did.  This is really a good photo of her, I bet she''d love it.  Congratulations on first page honors  :)', '2010-07-12 09:48:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6089279, 895578, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really liked this the minute I saw it in the challenge.  She just emanates such a story.  I bet she would love this picture too.</td>', 'I really liked this the minute I saw it in the challenge.  She just emanates such a story.  I bet she would love this picture too.', '2010-07-12 09:50:03.000000', NULL, 0),
