(6089332, 895565, 554, '<td valign="top">Dang Steve,  I knew I had seen that old feller before.  You have the light just right.  Your wife took this didn''t she?  :}</td>', 'Dang Steve,  I knew I had seen that old feller before.  You have the light just right.  Your wife took this didn''t she?  :}', '2010-07-12 10:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
