(6089351, 895332, 104009, '<td valign="top">i gave this an 8.  aside from the over brightness of the shot i''d have scored it a 10.  love it.</td>', 'i gave this an 8.  aside from the over brightness of the shot i''d have scored it a 10.  love it.', '2010-07-12 11:06:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6089352, 895565, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice work, Steve. Well deserved.</td>', 'Nice work, Steve. Well deserved.', '2010-07-12 11:06:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6089380, 895668, 66384, '<td valign="top">Timmy, I thought this was going to get the blue ribbon. It is the only one in the challenge that stuck in my mind. I didn''t understand the title either, but I never judge a photo based on the title. I disagree with the comment that there are no whites in the image ... the catch light in his eye is white and the face is perfectly lit, IMO.</td>', 'Timmy, I thought this was going to get the blue ribbon. It is the only one in the challenge that stuck in my mind. I didn''t understand the title either, but I never judge a photo based on the title. I disagree with the comment that there are no whites in the image ... the catch light in his eye is white and the face is perfectly lit, IMO.', '2010-07-12 11:41:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6089382, 895565, 28322, '<td valign="top">Congrats buddy :)</td>', 'Congrats buddy :)', '2010-07-12 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6089384, 895674, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a beguiling face!!! Too bad about the blurred eye. I love my lensbaby, but have had a few disappointments with it too ... near misses on the focus.</td>', 'What a beguiling face!!! Too bad about the blurred eye. I love my lensbaby, but have had a few disappointments with it too ... near misses on the focus.', '2010-07-12 11:47:28.000000', NULL, 0),
