(6089410, 895103, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the face and especially the curls, even the crumbs. Wish I could process my shots as well as you do. I''m so glad you won''t be giving up ... look at all those favs!<br/> <br/>P.S. Pigeon poo is supposed to be good luck. I guess there''s some truth to that. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-07-12 11:08:36.</i></td>', 'Love the face and especially the curls, even the crumbs. Wish I could process my shots as well as you do. I''m so glad you won''t be giving up ... look at all those favs! P.S. Pigeon poo is supposed to be good luck. I guess there''s some truth to that. :)', '2010-07-12 12:07:35.000000', '2010-07-12 12:08:36.000000', 0),
