(6311157, 895565, 124815, '<td valign="top">I certainly think that this would take a ribbon for humor as well, on more time. But the shoe shiner got my rapt attention and left a note for it.</td>', 'I certainly think that this would take a ribbon for humor as well, on more time. But the shoe shiner got my rapt attention and left a note for it.', '2011-02-13 10:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6342993, 895616, 93565, '<td valign="top">Wow... I didn''t see this in voting. Exceptional shot. I am normally terrible at this sort of shooting, but really this is great in so many ways. The layout of the guns, his placement between them, and the exhibit identification number right on his cheek. It provides a nice commentary to things, including a human as an item within an expo of guns, especially with his deadpan expression.</td>', 'Wow... I didn''t see this in voting. Exceptional shot. I am normally terrible at this sort of shooting, but really this is great in so many ways. The layout of the guns, his placement between them, and the exhibit identification number right on his cheek. It provides a nice commentary to things, including a human as an item within an expo of guns, especially with his deadpan expression.', '2011-03-06 19:12:35.000000', NULL, 0),
